# M47 Execution Changes Log — Calendar Header, Global Accordions, Profile Restructure, Nutrition Redesign & Macro Overlay

Autonomous sprint following the strict TDD loop per task: failing tests →
implementation → targeted tests → backlog check-off → git commit, followed by a
full `fvm flutter analyze` and full `fvm flutter test`. Verification used the
project's pinned FVM SDK (Flutter 3.29.0).

## Task 1: Calendar Header Redesign
- `lib/ui/molecules/calendar_month_header.dart` — the shared clean month header
  (centered month label in a subtle capsule between two circular navigation
  buttons) is used by both the Schedule calendar and the history popup.
- Verified with `test/features/m47_calendar_header_test.dart` (header presence,
  pill styling, navigation, history reuse).

## Task 2: Global Accordion Pattern
- `lib/ui/molecules/accordion_section.dart` — standardized collapsible card:
  while **collapsed only the main title is visible**; the subtitle (when
  present) and body are revealed exclusively on expansion (subtitle moves into
  the body by default), with a rotating chevron and animated size. Added the
  `subtitleInHeaderWhenExpanded` option for surfaces that keep the subtitle in
  the header.
- Tests: `test/ui/m47_global_accordion_test.dart` (title-only collapsed,
  reveal on expand, collapse again, header subtitle option); updated
  `test/ui/accordion_section_test.dart` for the new standard.

## Task 3: Profile Restructuring & Testing Panel
- `lib/ui/pages/profile_page.dart` — reorganized into four accordions:
  "Ajustes de Usuario" (profile form, `profile_user_settings_accordion`),
  Daily Symptoms (`profile_symptoms_accordion`), "Ajustes de Sistema"
  (`profile_settings_accordion`, notification toggles with the Language
  switcher at the very bottom) and "Pruebas" (`profile_tests_accordion`).
- `lib/ui/molecules/tests_panel.dart` — new "Pruebas" panel: meal test
  notification (`settings_meal_test_button`), nightly check-in and exercise
  test triggers.
- `lib/ui/molecules/settings_panel.dart` — reduced to notification preferences
  only (language rendered below it by the page).
- `lib/ui/pages/nutrition_page.dart` — removed the reactive-notifications
  toggle and all test-notification triggers.
- i18n: added `userSettingsTitle`, `systemSettingsTitle`, `testsSectionTitle`,
  `mealTestButton` (EN/ES); probe updated.
- Tests: `test/features/m47_profile_restructure_test.dart`; updated the M46
  notification-trigger, M27 reactive-notification and M32 EXERCISE-NOT tests to
  the relocated/removed state; `i18n_language_switcher_test` and
  `i18n_full_coverage_widget_test` updated to expand System Settings.

## Task 4: Nutrition Input & Quick Add Redesign
- i18n: added `addFoodsTitle` ("Añadir alimentos" / "Add foods") and
  `logAMealShortTitle` ("Registrar una comida" / "Log a meal"); the Nutrition
  tab now renders these titles.
- `lib/core/theme/app_theme.dart` — new `AppRadius.pill` and
  `AppInputDecoration.rounded(...)` shared input style: filled `surface800`
  fields with fully-rounded pill borders, a brighter focused border and a red
  error border.
- Applied across `nutrition_page`, `profile_page`, `quick_add_grams_dialog`,
  `daily_log_sheet`, `settings_page` and the calendar history editor.
- `lib/ui/organisms/weekly_stats_sheet.dart` — replaced the standalone macro
  tile row with a single **overlaid macro bar** (`weekly_macro_overlay`)
  presenting protein (`weekly_protein_overlay`) and fat
  (`weekly_fat_overlay`) in one capsule above the balance chart.
- Tests: `test/features/m47_nutrition_redesign_test.dart`,
  `test/features/m47_macro_overlay_test.dart`; updated
  `test/features/m46_weekly_stats_macros_test.dart`.

## Task 5: Testing & Verification
- `fvm flutter analyze` — No issues found.
- `fvm flutter test` (full suite) — **806 passed, 0 failed** (up from 789 at
  sprint start; +17 net tests).

